# SCENARIO: audit_wake_walk   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 2 server truth, population kinds. NEEDS the Phase 2 build (see audit_probe_thais.steps).
# B2-shaped and CAMERA-FREE on purpose (review R7: a camera is an observer and wakes its bot, so it
# must never be part of a wake-realism measurement). Without a camera every `@srv audit` toggle goes
# through the bot_commands queue: one production row each.
# Records wake / hib / state for EVERY bot ("*" = low-rate kinds only: probe, path and walkpause are
# never recorded for `*`, they need explicit names) plus the 10 s census, while the player walks
# temple -> depot -> temple. merge.py joins each `wake` record
# to p1's see_appear of the same bot (latency.json audit.wake_to_p1_appear; result.md).
@srv audit kinds wake,hib,state,census,cmd
@srv audit watch *
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32365,32214,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 hold 30
@p1 goto 32369,32238,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=180
@p1 hold 30
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=wake result=ok min=1 within=600
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=census min=5 within=600
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=state min=1 within=600 optional=1
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=hib min=0 within=600
@srv expect-none src=srv:audit k=probe within=600
@srv expect-none src=srv:audit k=path within=600
@srv audit watch clear
@srv audit off
@p1 logout
